' A DRAW whose end is off the screen draws nothing, sets ERR_NR to 4 ("5 Out of screen") and the
' program carries on; the last point plotted stays (semantics annex: plot-off-screen)
'@expect screen 0 "go"
'@expect screen 1 "after 10 10"
'@expect peek 23610 4
PLOT 10, 10
PRINT "go"
DRAW 250, 0
PRINT "after "; PEEK 23677; " "; PEEK 23678
